msgctxt "420"
msgid "Welcome! Welcome! It's nice to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Hmm? Looks like you got a full house today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "My employee's wife went into labor, and he had to rush to the hospital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Of course I'd like to be there with them, but look at all these customers. "
"And I'm all alone here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Anyway, what can I get you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Welcome! Welcome! It's nice to see you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Sorry about this. My help hasn't come back yet, and we're packed today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Anyway, just let me know when you're ready to order!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "You got it! Tell me what you want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Why don't I help you out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Really? You sure about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure. It's the least I can do for all the great ramen I've eaten "
"here. What should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Can you take orders from the customers for me? Just tell me the type of "
"ramen each customer wants in the order they asked for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Make sure not to mix up the customer order and the types of ramen each "
"person wants!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "All right. I'll give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"Tell the owner which ramen each customer wants in the order they asked for "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"If you mess up any orders, the customers will get mad. Focus, and take each "
"order carefully."
msgstr ""

